config RV_MON_OOB_TRAP
	depends on RV
	depends on RV_MON_DOVETAIL
	default y
	select HA_MON_EVENTS_ID
	bool "oob_trap monitor"
	help
	  Per-task monitor checking the Dovetail trap contract: every
	  exception the arch code must notify, taken out-of-band, is notified
	  with its trap number, every out-of-band trap notification is
	  unwound once for the same trap,
	  the trap exit handler returns with hard irqs off, no task is demoted
	  from interrupt or NMI context, and no task schedules out while a
	  kprobe is being handled, and every trap ends within timeout_ms. With
	  Cobalt, the task must also be demoted for every user mode trap.

	  For further information, see:
	    Documentation/trace/rv/monitor_dovetail.rst
